  "id": "wrenbury-vale-show-2026-cattle",
  "title": "Wrenbury Vale County Show 2026 — Cattle",
  "description": "Seven judged classes across three breeds, three breed championships and the supreme cattle championship. Nothing here is measured: there is no time, no weight and no score. Each class is an order one judge decided by eye, so every ranking declares ties: \"resolved\" with an empty sortBy (§8.2.1, §8.3.5) and the order is carried entirely by the published positions in ranks. The judge's spoken reasons are recorded in notes, which §7.4.1 says nothing will parse. Prize money is recorded as a measure of kind money whose betterWhen is none: it follows from the placing and never decides it. Version 2, amended: one yearling heifer was disqualified after the ring on a registration irregularity and the animals behind her have moved up.",
  "lang": "en",
  "status": "amended",
  "version": 2,
